	(text "Power entry: +5V from an external 5 V supply, +24V for the wind sensor (10-30 V),\n+3V3 from the FireBeetle regulator. PWR_FLAGs mark the external sources."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "50edf7c5-819d-490c-a2f2-928a9d7acbd3")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n- Valve GPIOs come from CONFIG_DYNAMIC_VALVE_GPIO_LIST = 1,14,18,21,22,16,17,5\n  (valves 1-8, CONFIG_DEVICE_MAX_VALVES = 8). All 8 relay channels are valves.\n- GPIO 16/17 are UART0: the console runs on USB Serial/JTAG.\n- No safe GPIO is left: more valves, the 24 VAC converter enable, mains-detect,\n  battery sense and the LCD need an I2C expander / I2C ADC.\n- Relay contacts are not in the relay module symbol:\n  J2 pin 1 -> COM1..8, NO1..8 -> valves 1..8, J2 pin 2 -> valve common.\n- IO6/IO7 reserved for the ESP32-S3 UART link (not drawn yet).\n- I2C pull-ups are on the breakout boards.\n  BMP581: SDO=GND (address 0x46), CS=3V3 (I2C mode).\n- 1.8k/3.3k dividers scale the 0-5 V sensor outputs to 0-3.24 V.\n- Not drawn yet: ESP32-S3, LCD2004, 24 VAC converter, battery path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "770e0efa-5809-4519-84b7-ad754eedb790")
	)
